-- HavenCore: Normal dungeon level scaling (8.3.7).
-- Creatures in Normal dungeons scaled with the player up to level 100 (LevelScalingMax 100)
-- instead of the dungeon's range. Ranges come from the 8.3.7 client (LFGDungeons.db2,
-- Normal difficulty): e.g. Ragefire Chasm / Deadmines 15-60, Hellfire Ramparts 58-80,
-- Throne of the Tides 80-90, Eye of Azshara 98-110, Atal'Dazar 110-120.
-- Only rows that already scale (LevelScalingMin/Max > 0) for DifficultyID 1 are changed;
-- fixed-level creatures and Heroic/Mythic rows are untouched. Creatures spawned in several
-- dungeons with different ranges are skipped. Idempotent.

